From: Timur Ravilov <93673987+t0b1kent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:05:02 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] Elden Ring lane: JIT statistics, writable-code
 validation modes, ARM64EC TLS fixes

Source of the diagnostic FEX used for the Elden Ring runs 098-102 (xtajit64.dll a51dc80f,
artifacts/elden-ring-20260915/fex-jitstats): the "macrunner-fex-jit" statistics line
(compilations, repeats, IR/codegen time, buffer flushes, invalidations),
MACRUNNER_FEX_WRITABLE_VALIDATION modes 1-3 (mode 3 also validates control-transfer
instructions in writable code), the "macrunner-fex-codechanged" log, and the ARM64EC
Module.cpp changes of candidates 087-tls..092.
All new behaviour is behind MACRUNNER_FEX_* environment switches; not in MacRunner 1.0.2.

